// expect: 0
// LSP hover fixture — the serve transport infers this on didOpen, then a hover
// reads the live type off the one graph. double's body forces x : Int (x + x),
// so a hover over an identifier projects a concrete type: null on a driverless
// (open_file-only) transport, the real type once the frontend runs.
fn double(x) = x + x
fn quad(y) = double(double(y))
